{
 "about": [
  "The originals pv_*.mat are MATLAB R2027a saves (make_cellswap_fixtures.m). Each mut_*.mat is its original with the",
  "edit applied by an independent cell swap (one value cell replaced, every other record and every other subsystem",
  "byte kept), and each exp_*.mat is MATLAB's own save of the same edit applied to a fresh load of the original.",
  "matlab: MATLAB R2027a loaded the mutant and compared every property of every variable with its own edit",
  "(PASS also needs no load warning, the edit to have taken effect, a shared handle kept, and a re-save to reload",
  "identically). sameAsMatlabSave: the mutant's inflated subsystem is byte for byte the one in exp_*.mat.",
  "A value is a MatVariable as core holds it: numeric data row-major."
 ],
